"Covered Material" means the original material distributed under this license,
including repository source code, scripts, configuration, templates,
documentation, observation text, photographs, videos, other original media,
and copyrightable selection or arrangement of those materials. It includes
modified versions and adaptations licensed under section 4. This license is
granted by each copyright holder only for rights that holder can license.

Separately licensed third-party material is excluded. Its own license and
notices control, including when it is bundled with Covered Material. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md where supplied. This license does not claim ownership
of unprotectable facts, ideas, methods, or material in the public domain.

"LLM System" means a large language model, including a multimodal model with
language-processing or language-generation capabilities, or an application,
assistant, agent, service, or pipeline that uses such a model to process
Covered Material. Local, self-hosted, remote, commercial, noncommercial,
research, and human-supervised systems are all included.

"You" means a natural person or a legal entity exercising rights granted by
this license. Restrictions apply to You and to systems acting on Your behalf;
the license does not depend on treating a model as a legal person.

